ic_timestamp":"2023-04-18T07:47:39Z"},{"note":"Rates, allowances and duties have been updated for tax year 2023 to 2024.","public_timestamp":"2023-04-05T23:15:15Z"},{"note":"The Lower Profits Limit for when self-employed people start paying Class 4 National Insurance has been updated.","public_timestamp":"2023-03-21T15:03:00Z"},{"note":"The Class 2 and 4 National Insurance rates have been updated for 2022 to 2023.","public_timestamp":"2022-12-20T09:43:12Z"},{"note":"The Class 1, 2 and 4 National Insurance rates have been updated for 2022 to 2023. ","public_timestamp":"2022-11-06T00:15:07Z"},{"note":"Rates and allowances for National Insurance contributions have been updated and will take effect from 6 July 2022.","public_timestamp":"2022-06-09T10:02:43Z"},{"note":"Rates, allowances and duties have been updated for tax year 2022 to 2023.","public_timestamp":"2022-04-06T08:00:08Z"},{"note":"Updated rates, allowances and duties for tax year 2021 to 2022.","public_timestamp":"2021-04-05T23:15:25Z"},{"note":"Rates, allowances and duties have been updated for tax year 2020 to 2021.","public_timestamp":"2020-04-05T23:45:00Z"},{"note":"Rates, allowances and duties have been updated for tax year 2019 to 2020.","public_timestamp":"2019-04-05T23:15:01Z"},{"note":"Rates, allowances and duties have been updated for tax year 2018 to 2019.","public_timestamp":"2018-04-05T23:30:18Z"},{"note":"Rates, allowances and duties have been updated for the tax year 2017 to 2018.","public_timestamp":"2017-04-05T23:15:21Z"},{"note":"The rates in section 1.2 monthly thresholds have been amended.","public_timestamp":"2016-05-10T10:34:50Z"},{"note":"Rates, allowances and duties have been updated for the tax year 2016 to 2017.","public_timestamp":"2016-04-05T23:15:28Z"},{"note":"Rates, allowances and duties have been updated for the tax year 2015 to 2016.","public_timestamp":"2015-04-05T23:30:23Z"},{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2014-01-01T00:00:00Z"}],"document_type_label":"Guidan